1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
Quentin Tarantino, one of the most acclaimed filmmakers of all time,

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:08,920
known for bringing his bold ideas to life with surreal visuals and mind-bending storytelling.

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,960
But he wasn't always a Hollywood icon,

4
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:14,280
once he was just an ordinary guy working at a video store.

5
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:17,360
Until one night, he decided to rewrite his story.

6
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,639
And there was like one night,

7
00:00:18,639 --> 00:00:19,920
stay up all night long,

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,200
and rather than give myself excuses,

9
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,559
I would look at everything that I'm in my life,

10
00:00:25,559 --> 00:00:27,120
or everything I'm not doing or whatever,

11
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:29,680
and just not give myself any excuses out,

12
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,680
just like nail it.

13
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:35,799
And I would spend like all night laying out everything I'm doing that's wrong.

14
00:00:35,799 --> 00:00:39,040
And then I would spend the last two hours figuring out how I can change it.

15
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,680
And as opposed to just doing it and then going to get some sleep,

16
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,799
I decided to change my life.

17
00:00:43,799 --> 00:00:46,480
Today, I present you the Tarantino method.

18
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:48,720
To follow this process, you'll need three things,

19
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,160
a pen, a notepad,

20
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:51,279
and the dead of night.

21
00:00:51,279 --> 00:00:53,959
When the world is silent and now the soul is awake,

22
00:00:53,959 --> 00:00:55,400
that's when it can happen.

23
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,040
Trust.

24
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,200
Now it begins.

25
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,200
The first page is always going to be the hardest,

26
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:03,080
but it's really all about getting that ball rolling.

27
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,120
Now that you've started,

28
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,839
you have to ask yourself the big,

29
00:01:05,839 --> 00:01:08,440
scary,fear-mongering question.

30
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:10,559
What am I doing wrong?

31
00:01:10,559 --> 00:01:11,839
Be brutally honest.

32
00:01:11,839 --> 00:01:13,639
As Quentin himself would say,

33
00:01:13,639 --> 00:01:14,760
nail it.

34
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:15,839
Take your time.

35
00:01:15,839 --> 00:01:16,800
Dive deep.

36
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,800
It's gritty.

37
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:18,760
It's tough,

38
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,800
but it's absolutely necessary.

39
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,440
And when you push through,

40
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,320
boom,

41
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:26,959
you're halfway there.

42
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:28,160
It's all out there.

43
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:28,919
The fears,

44
00:01:28,919 --> 00:01:29,639
the doubts,

45
00:01:29,639 --> 00:01:30,480
the mistakes,

46
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,199
the lessons,

47
00:01:31,199 --> 00:01:32,040
the heartbreak,

48
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,120
all laid out,

49
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,599
bare for you to see.

50
00:01:34,599 --> 00:01:36,040
Not built up in your mind,

51
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,160
but on paper,

52
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:39,400
tangible.

53
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,360
Take a moment,

54
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:42,400
because now you have to ask yourself,

55
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,599
how can I change it?

56
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:46,599
We're not all Quentin Tarantino.

57
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:48,879
You might be feeling like you're all written out.

58
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:50,720
So let's make this part simple,

59
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:52,320
a straightforward list,

60
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,480
a hundred ways you can change your life.

61
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,160
Quite a simple process.

62
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,879
Take a mistake you've learned

63
00:01:57,879 --> 00:01:59,800
and write down a way to change it.

64
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:02,239
Repeat it over and over again

65
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:03,279
and push forward.

66
00:02:03,279 --> 00:02:04,120
Write it down,

67
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:04,879
adapt,

68
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:05,599
reflect,

69
00:02:05,599 --> 00:02:06,279
learn,

70
00:02:06,279 --> 00:02:06,959
and grow.

71
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,080
Until finally,

72
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,240
when you ask yourself,

73
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,600
how can I change my life?

74
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,080
You'll have a hundred ways to do it.

75
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,720
But there's one very important thing

76
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,679
you need to remember throughout this whole night.

77
00:02:15,679 --> 00:02:18,880
You gotta actually f***ing do it.


